   \[
   \text{Expected from Aces} = \frac{4}{52} \times 1 
   \]

2. **Cards 2-10:**
   Each card yields its face value, so:
   \[
   \text{Expected from 2-10} = \sum_{i=2}^{10} \left( \frac{7}{52} \times i \right) 
   = \frac{7}{52} \times (2 + 3 + 4 + 5 + 6 + 7 + 8 + 9 + 10)
   = \frac{7}{52} \times 54 
   \]

3. **Face Cards:**
   \[
   \text{Expected from Face Cards} = \frac{12}{52} \times 20 
   \]

